{"4419130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fifty Miles Out", "steam_appid": 4419130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fifty Miles Out</strong> is a narrative-driven, single-player FPS action-horror experience about being in the wrong place at the worst possible time,  turning a simple commute home  into a horror-filled, explosive night of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/extras/05301522861de1d2a6b47b1fba3d41fa.avif?t=1779739585\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/extras_big/05301522861de1d2a6b47b1fba3d41fa.webp?t=1779739585 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After running out of fuel on the backroads of Arkansas, you are faced with trespassing onto the property of Burt Redfield(aka Red), a hardened, retired military veteran. Together, you are forced to confront the growing threat of <strong>Specimens</strong>, aggressive, genetically altered  humans born from a classified government experiment gone wrong.  Defend the property... but above all, defend yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/extras/f614f1ef582dbdbe7c67133f858759df.avif?t=1779739585\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/extras_big/f614f1ef582dbdbe7c67133f858759df.webp?t=1779739585 width=1560 height=501 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tightly focused story-driven experience (~1 hour)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror-infused action with FPS combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-rich environments with storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfiltered dialogue and situational humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles and Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/extras/41363b0de713c504d3d43fb73aac1ed6.avif?t=1779739585\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/extras_big/41363b0de713c504d3d43fb73aac1ed6.webp?t=1779739585 width=1560 height=477 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fifty Miles Out</strong> is a narrative-driven, single-player FPS action-horror experience about being in the wrong place at the worst possible time,  turning a simple commute home  into a horror-filled, explosive night of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/extras/05301522861de1d2a6b47b1fba3d41fa.avif?t=1779739585\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/extras_big/05301522861de1d2a6b47b1fba3d41fa.webp?t=1779739585 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After running out of fuel on the backroads of Arkansas, you are faced with trespassing onto the property of Burt Redfield(aka Red), a hardened, retired military veteran. Together, you are forced to confront the growing threat of <strong>Specimens</strong>, aggressive, genetically altered  humans born from a classified government experiment gone wrong.  Defend the property... but above all, defend yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/extras/f614f1ef582dbdbe7c67133f858759df.avif?t=1779739585\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/extras_big/f614f1ef582dbdbe7c67133f858759df.webp?t=1779739585 width=1560 height=501 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tightly focused story-driven experience (~1 hour)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror-infused action with FPS combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-rich environments with storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfiltered dialogue and situational humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles and Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/extras/41363b0de713c504d3d43fb73aac1ed6.avif?t=1779739585\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/extras_big/41363b0de713c504d3d43fb73aac1ed6.webp?t=1779739585 width=1560 height=477 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Fifty Miles Out is a single-player FPS action-horror experience. Stranded after running out of fuel, you seek help along a rural gravel lane when you are drafted by a retired military veteran to face violent encounters tied to a classified government experiment gone awry.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/1878dab7a9362e6861088b5828eefb5c1e3d1154/header.jpg?t=1779739585", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/38b0fae0f550738e098f07d5b67485dcad8daa7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779739585", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419130/38b0fae0f550738e098f07d5b67485dcad8daa7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779739585", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-12100F / AMD Ryze